WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.258
The morning was dark, without a bit of sunshine.

2
00:00:10.259 --> 00:00:13.113
It was rather chilly too.

3
00:00:13.114 --> 00:00:17.124
Hana: Bada, don't forget your umbrella.

4
00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:21.336
Bada: My umbrella? Why?

5
00:00:21.337 --> 00:00:24.167
Hana: It might rain today.

6
00:00:24.168 --> 00:00:26.346
Bada: How do you know?

7
00:00:26.347 --> 00:00:30.393
Hana: The weather forecast said so last night.

8
00:00:30.394 --> 00:00:33.230
Bada: I don't see any raindrops.

9
00:00:33.231 --> 00:00:35.735
Do you want to bet?

10
00:00:35.736 --> 00:00:37.869
Mom: Your sister is right.

11
00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:41.014
Take your umbrella, just in case.

12
00:00:41.015 --> 00:00:42.829
Hana: I told you!

13
00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:45.562
My brother never listens to me.

14
00:00:45.563 --> 00:00:47.547
See you, Mom!

15
00:00:47.548 --> 00:00:49.110
Mom: See you later.

16
00:00:49.111 --> 00:00:51.732
Both of you have a good day!

17
00:00:51.733 --> 00:00:55.678
We made a bet to see whether or not it would rain.

18
00:00:55.679 --> 00:00:57.925
Can you guess who won?

19
00:00:57.926 --> 00:01:01.463
The loser had to take out the garbage that night.
